Package: zoomriya-connect
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA Connect on the box: reaching it from away from home
 zoomriya-connectd is the box's side of ZOOMRIYA Connect: it gives the box
 its name (<name>.zoomriya.app) and certificate, keeps the list of paired
 phones and laptops, hands out their passes, and lets in nobody else, on
 every path. It stays idle until an admin switches ZOOMRIYA Connect on in Box
 Desktop; the box needs it for nothing else.
